00:39:41,900 --> 00:39:47,060
And some of our normal college students are not here because of spring break.

384
00:39:47,060 --> 00:39:49,160
And so I just want to take a moment for us.

385
00:39:49,240 --> 00:39:50,340
I'd love for you to join me.

386
00:39:50,340 --> 00:39:51,660
I just want to pray over you all.

387
00:39:51,660 --> 00:39:54,760
You are at a unique stage in your life.

388
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:59,320
And there is a ton of potential for God to move and work.

389
00:39:59,320 --> 00:40:02,820
And you also have challenging decisions to make.

390
00:40:02,820 --> 00:40:05,640
So I just want to pray for you and ask that the Holy Spirit would guide you.

391
00:40:05,640 --> 00:40:10,100
Father in heaven, we thank you for these students that are present.

392
00:40:10,100 --> 00:40:14,540
We thank you for the ones that are typically present and are at home

393
00:40:14,540 --> 00:40:16,440
visiting their local churches.

394
00:40:17,420 --> 00:40:21,360
God, we thank you that your kingdom is a multi-generational one.

395
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:26,180
And that the younger generation is not the future of the church.

396
00:40:26,180 --> 00:40:27,720
It is the present of the church.

397
00:40:27,720 --> 00:40:30,360
God, we need these students.

398
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:31,540
We need their input.

399
00:40:31,540 --> 00:40:34,460
We need their leadership in our churches.

400
00:40:34,460 --> 00:40:35,440
And so I just pray.

401
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:41,340
Pray for these students that they would view themselves as a valuable part of the kingdom of God now.

402
00:40:41,340 --> 00:40:45,680
That they're not preparing to be a valuable part of the kingdom later.

403
00:40:45,680 --> 00:40:47,760
That they are a valuable part of the kingdom now.

404
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:52,340
God, that you would give them wisdom and direction and joy.

405
00:40:52,340 --> 00:40:54,880
That they would enjoy this season of their life.

406
00:40:54,880 --> 00:41:01,200
Surrender it to you for your glory, for their good, and for the good of the people that are around them.

407
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:03,080
In Jesus' name I pray.

408
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:03,980
Amen.

409
00:41:04,380 --> 00:41:06,860
Go in peace, church.

410
00:41:06,860 --> 00:41:11,640
Unless you're like 58 and a half or older, then stick around for a legacy lunch.

411
00:41:11,640 --> 00:41:11,780
Thank you.

412
00:41:41,640 --> 00:41:48,360
Thank you.
